[node name="Vanity" type="Node3D"]
metadata/_doc = "Floating vanity 1.40 x 0.52 m, walnut drawers under a marble top (0.86 m) with an integrated basin. Origin = floor below the back center, on the wall plane; front +Z. Both drawers slide out 0.40 m by their pulls, slide on after release and soft-close; things put inside ride along. Lift the mixer lever (0..30 degrees; it stays where it's left). A warm LED strip under the cabinet lights the floor. The soap dispenser is a pickable."

